1
00:01:54,356 --> 00:01:56,356


2
00:03:06,350 --> 00:03:07,940
The southern fort has fallen!

3
00:03:08,100 --> 00:03:09,780
Advance to the eastern fort!

4
00:03:10,055 --> 00:03:11,582
Down below is already done for!

5
00:03:14,240 --> 00:03:15,573
The northern fort has fallen!

6
00:03:22,030 --> 00:03:24,660
The X-Union army is right upon us.

7
00:03:25,499 --> 00:03:28,060
I ordered our entire army to be divided into four units

8
00:03:28,399 --> 00:03:31,900
and deployed to the forts in all four directions!

9
00:03:32,454 --> 00:03:35,519
Yet not a single troop has arrived at any fort!

10
00:03:36,205 --> 00:03:38,520
Where on earth has the Silverland army vanished to?

11
00:03:39,534 --> 00:03:40,578
What is Duralumin doing

12
00:03:40,602 --> 00:03:42,558
at a critical time like this...?

13
00:03:52,280 --> 00:03:53,805
You're late, Great Duke Duralumin!

14
00:03:53,829 --> 00:03:55,960
What is the Silverland army doing?!

15
00:04:01,655 --> 00:04:03,480
Answer me, Great Duke Duralumin!

16
00:04:21,000 --> 00:04:22,839
M-Minister, what are you doing?!

17
00:04:26,980 --> 00:04:27,971
What, X-Union?!

18
00:04:28,515 --> 00:04:29,960
You betrayed us, Duralumin!

19
00:04:32,380 --> 00:04:35,038
I've finished off all the kingdom's leaders.

20
00:04:35,062 --> 00:04:37,945
These are the mighty warriors of the X-Union!

21
00:04:37,969 --> 00:04:41,660
And as of right now, I am the King of Silverland!

22
00:04:42,635 --> 00:04:44,320
Now, you must die!

23
00:04:44,420 --> 00:04:45,518
Damn you, traitor!

24
00:04:45,542 --> 00:04:46,586
You sold out our kingdom!

25
00:04:52,466 --> 00:04:52,986
Finish them off!

26
00:04:53,790 --> 00:04:56,260
Get rid of those three intruders!

27
00:05:12,440 --> 00:05:13,860
Sapphire, hurry over here!

28
00:05:14,116 --> 00:05:15,442
After them! After them!

29
00:05:35,250 --> 00:05:36,820
It's the Skull Chamber! Quick, get inside!

30
00:05:39,790 --> 00:05:42,226
Grand Duke Duralumin has betrayed us!

31
00:05:43,000 --> 00:05:44,500
Strike down the usurper King!

32
00:05:46,720 --> 00:05:49,580
Kill anyone who sides with the King!

33
00:05:53,070 --> 00:05:54,926
Down with Grand Duke Duralumin!

34
00:05:55,280 --> 00:05:57,148
Let's defeat the evil Grand Duke together

35
00:05:57,172 --> 00:05:59,120
and save the King!

36
00:06:01,026 --> 00:06:03,780
That was a mistake!

37
00:06:20,810 --> 00:06:22,415
This is what happens to anyone who resists!

38
00:06:22,439 --> 00:06:24,793
Shut up and do as you're told!

39
00:06:30,510 --> 00:06:33,800
No one can enter the Skull Chamber unless they break down the wall.

40
00:06:36,533 --> 00:06:37,860
Then we can't get out either?

41
00:06:38,260 --> 00:06:40,895
No, no, Sapphire, you can get out.

42
00:06:40,919 --> 00:06:43,900
Long ago, there was another traitor.

43
00:06:44,646 --> 00:06:46,788
The King and his family barricaded themselves

44
00:06:46,812 --> 00:06:48,608
in this Skull Chamber back then, too.

45
00:06:49,339 --> 00:06:51,388
A prince escaped from here alone,

46
00:06:51,412 --> 00:06:53,840
defeated the traitor, and restored the kingdom.

47
00:06:54,230 --> 00:06:55,415
And the King and Queen?

48
00:06:55,439 --> 00:06:56,646
They died here.

49
00:06:57,450 --> 00:06:59,915
But the prince brilliantly rebuilt his kingdom.

50
00:06:59,939 --> 00:07:01,801
So Sapphire, you must—

51
00:07:02,819 --> 00:07:03,475
No!

52
00:07:03,885 --> 00:07:05,380
I won't be the only one to escape!

53
00:07:05,880 --> 00:07:07,200
Father, Mother!

54
00:07:07,285 --> 00:07:09,260
Sapphire, listen to us carefully.

55
00:07:09,975 --> 00:07:11,586
No! I won't leave you!

56
00:07:13,790 --> 00:07:14,788
Sapphire!

57
00:07:15,065 --> 00:07:17,320
Is that any way for the heir of Silverland to act?

58
00:07:17,880 --> 00:07:18,801
It's an order!

59
00:07:18,825 --> 00:07:20,173
Obey your King!

60
00:07:21,160 --> 00:07:22,568
You must escape from here and,

61
00:07:22,592 --> 00:07:27,620
no matter the hardship, take Silverland back from that coward!

62
00:07:28,375 --> 00:07:29,235
Listen, Sapphire.

63
00:07:29,259 --> 00:07:31,793
This secret passage is barely wide enough for a single child.

64
00:07:32,043 --> 00:07:33,241
Escape through here.

65
00:07:34,252 --> 00:07:36,566
 And take these with you.

66
00:07:38,240 --> 00:07:39,727
Legend says the gold orb represents the royal family,

67
00:07:39,752 --> 00:07:41,381
the silver orb Silverland,

68
00:07:41,405 --> 00:07:44,860
and the bronze orb the people.

69
00:07:45,310 --> 00:07:49,481
These three orbs hold a secret power to protect the kingdom.

70
00:07:50,585 --> 00:07:52,386
Now go, Sapphire!

71
00:07:53,050 --> 00:07:53,648
Father...

72
00:07:53,672 --> 00:07:54,940
Go, quickly.

73
00:07:55,670 --> 00:07:56,840
Mother...

74
00:07:57,040 --> 00:07:58,595
Don't hesitate, Sapphire.

75
00:07:58,619 --> 00:08:00,720
Go face your destiny!

76
00:08:01,719 --> 00:08:03,180
Farewell, Sapphire.

77
00:08:03,540 --> 00:08:04,301
Sapphire...

78
00:08:04,325 --> 00:08:05,881
Father, Mother...

79
00:08:05,905 --> 00:08:07,155
I will definitely come save you!

80
00:08:07,332 --> 00:08:08,279
Please wait for me!

81
00:08:22,020 --> 00:08:25,580
Break through quickly! Drag Sapphire and the King out!

82
00:08:52,659 --> 00:08:54,300
Everyone's wearing an X mark.

83
00:08:55,265 --> 00:08:57,635
We must hurry and hold Plastic's coronation

84
00:08:57,659 --> 00:08:59,761
before Lord X's retinue arrives!

85
00:08:59,785 --> 00:09:02,160
Gather everyone in the castle in the grand hall!

86
00:09:02,740 --> 00:09:03,740
I understand.

87
00:09:04,180 --> 00:09:07,520
At last, Silverland is mine!

88
00:09:14,099 --> 00:09:15,540
Under the X-Union Army!

89
00:09:16,080 --> 00:09:17,600
Advance to Grand Duke Duralumin!

90
00:09:18,055 --> 00:09:20,800
Lord X's army is five kilometers away!

91
00:09:21,289 --> 00:09:22,566
Are you ready to disperse?!

92
00:09:23,229 --> 00:09:24,406
What? Only 5 kilometers to go?

93
00:09:24,879 --> 00:09:27,160
Then skip the ceremony!

94
00:09:27,335 --> 00:09:28,580
Listen up, everyone!

95
00:09:28,875 --> 00:09:32,933
As of this moment, my son Plastic is the King of Silverland!

96
00:09:35,125 --> 00:09:38,366
And I, Duralumin, shall rule in his place!

97
00:09:39,055 --> 00:09:41,040
Anyone who objects, step forward!

98
00:09:50,229 --> 00:09:52,240
Ring the celebration bells!

99
00:09:55,460 --> 00:09:56,960
Actually, I'll ring them myself!

100
00:09:57,960 --> 00:09:59,860
It's my beloved son's big day!

101
00:10:02,939 --> 00:10:05,260
A rain of celebration!

102
00:10:13,780 --> 00:10:16,035
Nylon!

103
00:10:16,792 --> 00:10:19,880
You betrayed me!

104
00:10:26,949 --> 00:10:29,273
Help!

105
00:10:44,980 --> 00:10:46,100
That's enough. That's enough.

106
00:10:46,313 --> 00:10:47,540
That's enough.

107
00:10:59,910 --> 00:11:00,980
Got a problem?

108
00:11:05,639 --> 00:11:06,788
I am king.

109
00:11:06,992 --> 00:11:09,028
I am now the King of Silverland.

110
00:11:09,192 --> 00:11:09,940
Wipe my face!

111
00:11:14,729 --> 00:11:15,729
I'm hungry!

112
00:11:17,769 --> 00:11:18,769
My shoulders are stiff!

113
00:11:30,310 --> 00:11:31,593
Stop it!

114
00:11:34,580 --> 00:11:35,534
Who are you?!

115
00:11:35,558 --> 00:11:36,880
 I am King Nylon!

116
00:11:36,965 --> 00:11:37,948
King Nylon?

117
00:11:37,972 --> 00:11:39,000
That ends now!

118
00:11:48,620 --> 00:11:49,941
The Ribbon Knight...

119
00:12:01,226 --> 00:12:02,226
Hey, wait!

120
00:12:15,613 --> 00:12:17,960
Lord X and the entire army have just arrived!

121
00:12:18,065 --> 00:12:19,065
Lord X!

122
00:12:19,888 --> 00:12:21,053
Lord X!

123
00:12:21,078 --> 00:12:22,159
We've been waiting for you, Lord X!

124
00:12:22,184 --> 00:12:22,892
Wait!

125
00:12:37,149 --> 00:12:38,381
Welcome!

126
00:12:38,405 --> 00:12:39,021
Help me!

127
00:12:39,045 --> 00:12:40,239
I love you, Lord X!

128
00:12:40,285 --> 00:12:42,354
Please defeat him!

129
00:12:42,378 --> 00:12:44,226
Hurry, defeat him quick!

130
00:12:44,375 --> 00:12:46,073
I am so truly honored by your arrival!

131
00:13:11,219 --> 00:13:12,813
Damn it! He got away!

132
00:13:13,878 --> 00:13:14,525
X!

133
00:13:17,159 --> 00:13:18,799
This kingdom will never perish!

134
00:13:18,823 --> 00:13:20,380
As long as we have these three orbs!

135
00:13:37,113 --> 00:13:38,113
Ribbon Knight!

136
00:13:57,221 --> 00:13:57,240
Understood...

137
00:14:01,769 --> 00:14:02,619
<i>Father,</i>

138
00:14:02,923 --> 00:14:03,705
<i>Mother,</i>

139
00:14:04,443 --> 00:14:06,559
<i>Franz and I will definitely come save you.</i>

140
00:14:07,129 --> 00:14:08,093
<i>Please wait for us.</i>

141
00:14:32,983 --> 00:14:33,983
Opal!

142
00:14:35,109 --> 00:14:35,832
It's Sapphire!

143
00:14:36,329 --> 00:14:37,026
Sapphire!

144
00:14:37,829 --> 00:14:38,745
Franz!

145
00:14:38,956 --> 00:14:39,840
Is that the Ribbon Knight?!

146
00:14:41,289 --> 00:14:41,725
Franz!

147
00:14:42,163 --> 00:14:43,072
It's terrible!

148
00:14:43,276 --> 00:14:45,326
At the castle, the King and Queen are...

149
00:14:45,879 --> 00:14:46,639
Franz!

150
00:14:47,103 --> 00:14:47,780
What's wrong?

151
00:14:48,853 --> 00:14:50,959
Why do you know so much about the castle?

152
00:14:51,129 --> 00:14:53,300
You... you love Sapphire, don't you?

153
00:14:53,760 --> 00:14:55,792
Sapphire was closer to you than to me, wasn't she?

154
00:14:56,103 --> 00:14:59,146
That's why you know everything about the castle and Sapphire!

155
00:15:00,329 --> 00:15:01,332
Go to Sapphire!

156
00:15:01,636 --> 00:15:02,980
I shouldn't see her anymore!

157
00:15:03,500 --> 00:15:05,412
You should be the one to take care of Sapphire!

158
00:15:05,789 --> 00:15:07,420
Someone like me... someone like me...

159
00:15:09,349 --> 00:15:11,220
What a clumsy, conceited fool!

160
00:15:11,990 --> 00:15:14,080
Goodbye! Protect Sapphire for me!

161
00:15:20,589 --> 00:15:21,356
Don't get in my way!

162
00:15:21,380 --> 00:15:22,313
Franz!

163
00:15:34,579 --> 00:15:37,713
Sapphire, you were the Ribbon Knight?

164
00:16:23,239 --> 00:16:24,814
I see... so that's how it is.

165
00:16:24,838 --> 00:16:26,900
Above all, let's rescue your parents first.

166
00:16:27,579 --> 00:16:31,060
Nylon has probably tightened security.

167
00:16:41,530 --> 00:16:43,247
A secret passage here?

168
00:16:43,271 --> 00:16:44,581
It leads straight up.

169
00:16:44,606 --> 00:16:46,033
Alright, let's hurry!

170
00:17:02,619 --> 00:17:03,546
I knew it...

171
00:17:03,571 --> 00:17:04,527
Father...

172
00:17:04,551 --> 00:17:05,839
Mother...

173
00:17:06,819 --> 00:17:07,940
Keep searching, Sapphire!

174
00:17:24,739 --> 00:17:25,407
<i>Mother,</i>

175
00:17:25,431 --> 00:17:26,407
<i>Father,</i>

176
00:17:26,431 --> 00:17:27,427
<i>please hang on...</i>

177
00:17:27,451 --> 00:17:28,540
A ventilation shaft, huh?

178
00:17:28,733 --> 00:17:29,940
Alright, let's go through here.

179
00:17:33,093 --> 00:17:33,655
<i>Announcement!</i>

180
00:17:33,979 --> 00:17:36,609
<i>At sunset today, at the northern ranch,</i>

181
00:17:36,633 --> 00:17:39,660
<i>the King and Queen will be executed!</i>

182
00:17:40,153 --> 00:17:41,200
<i>Executed...</i>

183
00:17:41,649 --> 00:17:44,320
<i>The King and Queen will be executed!</i>

184
00:17:45,379 --> 00:17:46,569
We can't waste time!

185
00:17:46,593 --> 00:17:47,980
We have to save them right away!

186
00:17:49,309 --> 00:17:50,320
Wait, this is suspicious!

187
00:17:50,546 --> 00:17:53,542
<i>At sunset today, at the northern ranch...</i>

188
00:17:53,719 --> 00:17:54,986
Come on, hurry!

189
00:17:55,079 --> 00:17:55,935
Something's wrong.

190
00:17:55,960 --> 00:17:58,220
It's as if they're saying this on purpose just for you to hear.

191
00:17:58,419 --> 00:17:59,002
But...

192
00:17:59,026 --> 00:18:02,349
The enemy knows we're lurking somewhere nearby,

193
00:18:02,373 --> 00:18:05,980
so they're making this announcement everywhere to lure you out.

194
00:18:06,004 --> 00:18:06,929
That has to be it.

195
00:18:06,953 --> 00:18:07,642
But...

196
00:18:07,666 --> 00:18:08,342
Listen,

197
00:18:08,366 --> 00:18:09,915
Sapphire, it's definitely a trap!

198
00:18:09,939 --> 00:18:13,613
Your parents are actually being held somewhere else.

199
00:18:18,139 --> 00:18:19,323
Not here either.

200
00:18:19,347 --> 00:18:20,860
Where could they be?

201
00:18:21,863 --> 00:18:23,283
Cheer up, Sapphire.

202
00:18:23,307 --> 00:18:26,206
Look, I'll search over there, so you look over that way.

203
00:18:26,769 --> 00:18:28,699
Then let's meet back here in 30 minutes, okay?

204
00:18:46,313 --> 00:18:47,969
So, Lord X,

205
00:18:47,993 --> 00:18:49,909
what do you think of my idea?

206
00:18:49,933 --> 00:18:52,323
The decree has reached every corner.

207
00:18:52,347 --> 00:18:54,980
By now, Sapphire must have heard the news.

208
00:18:56,099 --> 00:19:00,320
And I'm certain she'll come strolling right out to the northern ranch.

209
00:19:00,974 --> 00:19:02,080
So it really was a trap!

210
00:19:02,704 --> 00:19:04,760
Lord Nylon, you're speaking too loudly.

211
00:19:06,509 --> 00:19:07,776
What? "Lord" Nylon?

212
00:19:07,800 --> 00:19:10,113
What's this "Lord" nonsense? It's King! King Nylon!

213
00:19:10,839 --> 00:19:12,563
No, it's Lord Nylon.

214
00:19:12,587 --> 00:19:14,260
Lord X decided it.

215
00:19:15,553 --> 00:19:17,356
Lord X? That makes no sense.

216
00:19:17,380 --> 00:19:18,509
The one who betrayed the king and

217
00:19:18,533 --> 00:19:21,020
welcomed Lord X was to be made King of Silverland!

218
00:19:21,319 --> 00:19:25,220
Didn't you promise that yourself, Lord X?

219
00:19:35,319 --> 00:19:37,360
I do not keep promises.

220
00:19:38,920 --> 00:19:40,880
You don't keep promises?

221
00:19:41,179 --> 00:19:44,356
I don't. That is X's way.

222
00:19:44,380 --> 00:19:46,120
Got a problem with that, Nylon?

223
00:20:04,003 --> 00:20:04,700
Oh no!

224
00:20:19,939 --> 00:20:23,342
Stay back, stay back! Please, Duralu--! Stay away, stay away!

225
00:20:23,620 --> 00:20:25,040
 Help me!

226
00:20:44,233 --> 00:20:46,683
Help me, I beg you!

227
00:20:51,113 --> 00:20:52,083
Forgive me, Duralumin!

228
00:20:52,107 --> 00:20:53,523
Please don't hold a grudge against me!

229
00:20:53,547 --> 00:20:55,333
Look, I'm returning this to you!

230
00:20:56,016 --> 00:20:56,943
Nylon,

231
00:20:56,967 --> 00:20:59,506
how dare you betray me!

232
00:20:59,959 --> 00:21:01,853
No, forgive me.

233
00:21:02,359 --> 00:21:07,163
I'm waiting in Hell, yet neither the King nor the noble has arrived.

234
00:21:07,187 --> 00:21:10,066
Where are those two...?

235
00:21:11,404 --> 00:21:14,289
The King and Queen are set to be executed at sunset today on

236
00:21:14,313 --> 00:21:16,480
Skull Island, off the western coast.

237
00:21:16,780 --> 00:21:17,780
Execution?

238
00:21:17,959 --> 00:21:20,786
They were secretly sent away in a carriage long ago.

239
00:21:24,499 --> 00:21:25,860
Sapphire! Sapphire!

240
00:21:27,179 --> 00:21:28,640
I'm going to the northern ranch, Sapphire.

241
00:21:29,440 --> 00:21:30,440
Damn it.

242
00:21:30,804 --> 00:21:31,980
<i>Please, somehow hold on out there!</i>

243
00:21:32,160 --> 00:21:33,800
<i>I'm heading to Skull Island in the west.</i>

244
00:21:34,649 --> 00:21:35,483
Father!

245
00:21:35,507 --> 00:21:36,560
Mother!

246
00:21:57,149 --> 00:21:58,209
Father!

247
00:21:59,799 --> 00:22:01,060
You've fallen into my trap!

248
00:22:01,440 --> 00:22:02,146
Oh no!

249
00:22:20,186 --> 00:22:21,600
Opal! I'm counting on you!

250
00:22:41,183 --> 00:22:42,023
Now, tell the truth!

251
00:22:42,047 --> 00:22:44,020
Where are the King and Queen?

252
00:22:44,209 --> 00:22:45,496
To the west...

253
00:22:45,520 --> 00:22:46,749
Skull Island...

254
00:22:46,773 --> 00:22:47,829
At sunset...

255
00:22:47,854 --> 00:22:49,227
An execution...

256
00:22:49,320 --> 00:22:50,800
Execution?!

257
00:22:56,969 --> 00:22:59,926
God, please protect my father and mother.

258
00:23:12,539 --> 00:23:13,829
Mother!

259
00:23:14,253 --> 00:23:15,960
Father!

260
00:23:22,729 --> 00:23:24,300
The sun has set!

261
00:23:30,389 --> 00:23:32,400
The sun has already set!

262
00:23:48,487 --> 00:23:49,013
Franz!

263
00:23:56,686 --> 00:23:58,459
Father! Mother!

264
00:23:58,570 --> 00:24:03,205
I tried to catch up to the ship that was just pulling away and rescue them, but...

265
00:24:03,229 --> 00:24:05,813
Mother! Father!

266
00:24:11,979 --> 00:24:13,127
Don't cry, Sapphire!

267
00:24:13,151 --> 00:24:14,566
Sapphire, don't cry!

268
00:24:19,279 --> 00:24:20,574
Mother...

269
00:24:20,924 --> 00:24:22,754
Stand up, Sapphire!

270
00:24:23,251 --> 00:24:24,580
You have work to do!

271
00:24:25,244 --> 00:24:27,060
Take back your kingdom

272
00:24:27,085 --> 00:24:29,006
in the final battle against X!

273
00:24:30,224 --> 00:24:32,224

